{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 491, "line_no": 6, "text": "西北诸山》七律二首：", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 487, "w": 374, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "西北诸山》七律二首：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 487, "w": 374, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 491, "line_no": 7, "text": "沿流都有鹭鸶飞，空翠时时泌客衣。", "bbox_px": {"x": 442, "y": 555, "w": 615, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "沿流都有鹭鸶飞，空翠时时泌客衣。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 442, "y": 555, "w": 615, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 491, "line_no": 8, "text": "忽讶危崖突人影，似惊鸣镝启山扉。", "bbox_px": {"x": 442, "y": 620, "w": 619, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "忽讶危崖突人影，似惊鸣镝启山扉。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 442, "y": 620, "w": 619, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
